---
import { person } from "../data/site";
import ProjectPanels from "./ProjectPanels.astro";
---

<section id="top" class="relative overflow-hidden pt-24 md:pt-32">
  <div
    class="glow left-1/2 top-[-16rem] h-[28rem] w-[50rem] -translate-x-1/2 opacity-90"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
  </div>

  <div class="shell relative">
    <div
      class="reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-full border border-accent/25 bg-accent-soft px-3.5 py-1.5"
    >
      <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="font-mono text-[0.6875rem] tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-accent">
        {person.location}
      </span>
    </div>

    <h1
      class="reveal mt-8 max-w-[19ch] font-display text-[clamp(2.6rem,7.6vw,5.75rem)] font-semibold leading-[0.94] tracking-[-0.045em]"
      style="--reveal-delay:60ms"
    >
      I build things, then try to<br class="hidden sm:block" />
      <span class="relative whitespace-nowrap"
        >break them<svg
          class="absolute -bottom-1 left-0 h-[0.35em] w-full text-accent"
          viewBox="0 0 300 12"
          preserveAspectRatio="none"
          fill="none"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <path
            d="M2 8.5C60 3.5 140 2.5 298 6"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="3"
            stroke-linecap="round"></path>
        </svg></span
      >.
    </h1>

    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-10 md:mt-10 md:grid-cols-12 md:items-end">
      <p
        class="reveal max-w-2xl text-[1.0625rem] leading-relaxed text-dim md:col-span-7 md:text-lg"
        style="--reveal-delay:140ms"
      >
        Controllers, internal platforms and pipelines, mostly written in Go. An
        operator that keeps a workload matching its spec, a portal that turns a
        form into a running service, a vision pipeline that names the birds at a
        drinking trough. Everything here runs, and every number on this page is
        measured.
      </p>

      <div
        class="reveal flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 md:col-span-5 md:justify-end"
        style="--reveal-delay:200ms"
      >
        <a href="#work" class="btn btn-primary">
          See the work
          <svg
            class="h-3.5 w-3.5"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <path d="M12 5v14M6 13l6 6 6-6"></path>
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a href={person.github} class="btn btn-ghost" rel="me noopener">
          GitHub
          <svg
            class="arrow h-3 w-3"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <path d="M7 17 17 7M9 7h8v8"></path>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- One cover per project, straight away. -->
  <div class="mt-12 md:mt-14">
    <div class="shell reveal mb-4" style="--reveal-delay:240ms">
      <p class="flex items-center gap-2.5 font-mono text-[0.75rem] text-mute">
        <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"
        ></span>
        Some Go, some Kubernetes, one bird detector.
      </p>
    </div>
    <ProjectPanels />
  </div>
</section>
